  "limitations": [
    "Fixed19m model datum, photo-guided central roadway near27m with ten-metre upright arch rise and longer inclined outer ribs descending to standard-field stair feet. Long end approaches descend toward23.4/22m. Literal support/stair samples fit the unmodified standard viewer field; these are approximate visualization controls, not surveyed structural elevations.",
    "Three ordinary photos and current PMTiles guide this original medium-fi exterior. Rib curves, I sections, hanger count/anchors, braces, stair widths/tread counts, railings and structural supports are photo approximations; concealed engineering/interiors and readable graffiti/signs are excluded. The225m full retained envelope includes long approaches and four stair wings; the much smaller architectural core is modeled at its own plan stations. Old photos show open railway ground, but current map routes are tunnels; their hidden tracks are not added visibly. No copied photo pixels, downloaded meshes, vehicles or unique textures. Current native terrain/contact limitations and physical-device timing remain explicit."
